; zerobus-otlp-eio (§4.3): the Eio (direct-style) instantiation of the OTLP
; exporter. The Eio counterpart of zerobus-otlp (Lwt): unary LogsService /
; MetricsService Export over the Eio H2 client (reuses zerobus-eio's transport),
